#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:1
msgid "vtkSurfaceNets3D: Identify and correct non-manifold points"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:3
msgid ""
"`vtkSurfaceNets3D` now detects local 2x2x2 voxel neighborhoods which can "
"yield non-manifold edges/vertices if incident faces share points naively. "
"These configurations can occur even for binary segmentations (single "
"extracted label vs background), and additional cases can arise in multi-"
"label images depending on how labels meet in the neighborhood."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:8
msgid ""
"When a known split pattern exists, the filter resolves such neighborhoods by "
"selectively duplicating points so that incident faces are separated into "
"locally consistent components while still keeping coincident geometry where "
"regions share a face. Some detected non-manifold neighborhoods may remain "
"unresolvable; in those cases, the output may still contain non-manifold "
"connectivity locally."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:13
msgid ""
"To aid inspection/debugging, the filter now adds a point-data array named "
"`NonManifoldTableIndices` (signed int8) to the output. For each generated "
"output point:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:16
msgid ""
"`-2` means the neighborhood was treated as manifold (no point duplication)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:17
msgid ""
"`-1` means the neighborhood was detected as non-manifold but no split "
"pattern could be selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:18
msgid ""
"`0` or greater means a split pattern was selected; the value is an index "
"into an internal non-manifold metadata table used to choose the point "
"duplication pattern."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:21
msgid "Additional related improvements:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:23
msgid "The performance of the triangulation of the quads has been improved"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:24
msgid "A crash was fixed when `DataCaching` is off"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:25
msgid ""
"Pass 2 is run in odd/even slice phases to avoid a potential race when "
"reading neighboring-slice edge metadata"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:27
msgid ""
"Output generation has been accelerated by adding an additional pass "
"(`BuildOuterSpaceIndices`) which, for each volume cell row, traverses the "
"trim interval and records the x-position of every point-producing triad into "
"an auxiliary outer-space indices array. This allows Pass 5 to skip over non-"
"emitting triads inside a trimmed interval directly. The array uses a compact "
"unsigned integer type sized to the x-dimension."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:33
msgid ""
"Output connectivity will be saved in 32 or 64 bit arrays depending on what's "
"needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md:34
msgid ""
"`SetOptimizedSmoothingStencils` has been deprecated since it was not "
"actually used."
msgstr ""
